&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer Domain at Vinted is dedicated to creating a seamless and highly engaging experience for our members as they search, discover, and purchase items. Our challenge is unique: unlike standard e-commerce, our peer-to-peer catalogue consists of hundreds of millions of entirely unique, single-inventory listings, with millions of new items uploaded daily. Connecting the right buyer with the perfect item in real-time is at the very core of Vinted&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The CVP team owns the core platform and services that govern how content is geofenced, balanced, and surfaced across Vinted&#39;s growing international network of markets. We build robust systems and tooling that manage cross-border visibility, enabling smooth and gradual market connections (e.g., FR-DE, BE-FR-ES) while optimising key liquidity metrics like Sell-Through Rate (STR%) and Gross Merchandise Value (GMV) by balancing the content in multiple channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team works closely with Content Visibility Management, Search, and Recommender relevance teams to accelerate product development. Currently, we are driving the automation of content visibility experimentation &amp;amp; analysis. Rather than having different content channels independently re-implement visibility controls, we are building a unified platform to provide autonomy to Decision Scientists. In addition, we are highly contributing in growing new large markets such as the USA and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain highly scalable, reliable, and secure backend systems to ensure efficient content visibility and search mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide technical decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to and challenge the technical direction of our backend services, leading system design reviews and ensuring high-quality, maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale features globally:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and shape A/B tested features that positively impact our 80+ million users. Code changes are rolled out instantly to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your services:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and improve backend service performance and stability. The team owns and monitors service-layer measurements (SLIs, SLOs, etc.) and has an on-call rotation which you will participate in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead team-level initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and drive technical initiatives within the team, while collaborating on domain-wide integrations with other engineering teams (such as Search and Recommender relevance teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with engineering and product managers, analysts, and other stakeholders, facilitating clear communication within the team and across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to product direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical feasibility assessments, identify technical risks, and provide effort estimations to help shape our team&#39;s product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster engineering excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor, guide, and share knowledge with other engineers in the team to support their technical growth and promote collaborative best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience in backend software engineering, with a proven track record of designing and building scalable, distributed, and highly available systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly proficient in backend development. We primarily use Go, Kotlin, Ruby, Python — while prior experience in these specific languages is beneficial, a strong foundation in modern backend engineering and a willingness to learn is what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event streaming platforms like Kafka, Apache Flink, or others for real-time data processing and message queueing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record working with search engines, information retrieval and ranking optimisations technologies (e.g., Vespa, Elasticsearch, OpenSearch) is a high advantage. If not, we expect you to have a strong willingness and motivation to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are enthusiastic about AI technologies, use AI tools daily in your work, and proactively learn and experiment with how to adopt AI to boost engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of continuous integration and deployment pipelines, with experience in tools like Jenkins for automating builds and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and monitoring tools (we use Grafana, Kibana, and others) to keep services healthy and define SLIs/SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and in-memory databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience working with cross-functional peers (Product, Analytics, SRE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mentoring other engineers, providing constructive feedback, and promoting engineering best practices within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€104.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;What if you could own an entire region, from the first customer conversation to long-term growth?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mews, we’re creating a new leadership role for each of our EMEA regions, and we’re hiring the Head of Region for:&lt;br&gt;Benelux, Italy, Spain, Nordic, UK&amp;amp;IRE, France and DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring commercial growth, onboarding and customer success together under one regional strategy, accountable for performance, customer outcomes and the regional P&amp;amp;L within the plan you agree with our VP of EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t just about hitting a sales target. It’s about building a regional business where every part of the customer experience works together, from winning a hotel to helping it succeed on Mews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to our VP of EMEA, lead teams across commercial, onboarding and customer success, and have a real say in how we grow, operate and deliver value in the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a rare chance to combine commercial leadership, operational ownership and genuine influence over how we scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive growth across the region&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the regional go-to-market plan, new ARR and revenue from customers going live. You’ll run Business Development, SMB and Mid-Market Sales, Onboarding and Customer Success to win new customers, grow existing relationships and open up opportunities across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the entire customer experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring sales, onboarding and customer success together around one goal: making customers successful. From signature and go-live to adoption, renewal and expansion, you’ll make sure hotels experience one connected Mews journey, with a named owner at every hand-off. You’ll build executive relationships with the region’s largest hotels and groups, own recovery plans when a customer is at risk, and work with Product, Marketing and the central support and delivery teams to turn what you hear from customers into better outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run the region like a business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take ownership of the regional P&amp;amp;L within the plan agreed with the VP of EMEA, balancing revenue growth, headcount, capacity and controllable costs. You’ll work closely with Finance and RevOps to make sound commercial decisions and deliver steady performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and empower exceptional teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead through team leads and senior specialists across commercial, onboarding and customer success. Some of those teams are shared with other regions, so you’ll set up how they work together with the other regional leaders. You’ll create alignment, develop the next layer of leaders and build a culture where teams collaborate, take ownership and deliver results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape an AI-native business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re serious about using AI to change how we work. You’ll lead by example, building AI systems, tools and standards that help your team spot opportunities, make better decisions and spend more time on what matters. You’ll coach others, raise AI fluency across the region and decide where a person has to make the call.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a commercially minded leader who enjoys building businesses, developing people and connecting growth to customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of commercial success.&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years in B2B SaaS or hospitality commercial roles, including at least 3 years leading teams, consistently taking teams to and beyond target. You’ve owned a commercial number and built the go-to-market plan behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end customer leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve led onboarding, customer success, implementation or delivery teams, accountable for time to go-live, adoption, retention and net revenue retention, and you’ve led a team spanning more than one discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business acumen.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve owned a P&amp;amp;L or budget, including controllable costs, headcount and margin trade-offs, ideally across commercial and customer delivery teams, and you collaborate on the plan and numbers with Finance and RevOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ability to bring people together.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve developed talent, built a bench and guided teams through growth or change. You’re fluent in English and the primary language of the region, and comfortable building relationships with customers, colleagues and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An AI-first mindset backed by action.&lt;/strong&gt; AI Fluency Level 4, or equivalent hands-on experience: you’ve built AI tools, systems or standards that changed how a team operates, and you can show us what you built, who uses it and what changed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Even better if you have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hospitality or hotel technology, with an understanding of the challenges hotel operators face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a matrix organisation, collaborating with shared teams and influencing stakeholders across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;How we think about AI&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires &lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 4&lt;/strong&gt;. That means going beyond using AI tools yourself. You’ve built systems, standards or ways of working that others rely on, you coach others on the craft, and you decide what the region acts on when AI flags patterns across it, keeping human oversight in place where it matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/external/YWI5ZGUyMGQ3MjU2NGRmNjlkZGEyYTg2NTVmZGE0OTU&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best customer experience comes from shared ownership of the whole journey. As Head of Region, you’ll make that real shaping not just how we grow, but how we deliver for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is open to both internal and external candidates. Internal applications are already being considered, and both processes will run in parallel. All candidates will be assessed fairly against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€84.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€121.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£91,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£118,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€103.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€125.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€105.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€141.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€155.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;983 500 kr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 662 000 kr SEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€103.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€132.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Italy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€80.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€102.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer Domain at Vinted is dedicated to creating a seamless and highly engaging experience for our members as they search, discover, and purchase items. Our challenge is unique: unlike standard e-commerce, our peer-to-peer catalogue consists of hundreds of millions of entirely unique, single-inventory listings, with millions of new items uploaded daily. Connecting the right buyer with the perfect item in real-time is at the very core of Vinted&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The CVP team owns the core platform and services that govern how content is geofenced, balanced, and surfaced across Vinted&#39;s growing international network of markets. We build robust systems and tooling that manage cross-border visibility, enabling smooth and gradual market connections (e.g., FR-DE, BE-FR-ES) while optimising key liquidity metrics like Sell-Through Rate (STR%) and Gross Merchandise Value (GMV) by balancing the content in multiple channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team works closely with Content Visibility Management, Search, and Recommender relevance teams to accelerate product development. Currently, we are driving the automation of content visibility experimentation &amp;amp; analysis. Rather than having different content channels independently re-implement visibility controls, we are building a unified platform to provide autonomy to Decision Scientists. In addition, we are highly contributing in growing new large markets such as the USA and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain highly scalable, reliable, and secure backend systems to ensure efficient content visibility and search mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide technical decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to and challenge the technical direction of our backend services, leading system design reviews and ensuring high-quality, maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale features globally:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and shape A/B tested features that positively impact our 80+ million users. Code changes are rolled out instantly to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your services:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and improve backend service performance and stability. The team owns and monitors service-layer measurements (SLIs, SLOs, etc.) and has an on-call rotation which you will participate in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead team-level initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and drive technical initiatives within the team, while collaborating on domain-wide integrations with other engineering teams (such as Search and Recommender relevance teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with engineering and product managers, analysts, and other stakeholders, facilitating clear communication within the team and across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to product direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical feasibility assessments, identify technical risks, and provide effort estimations to help shape our team&#39;s product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster engineering excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor, guide, and share knowledge with other engineers in the team to support their technical growth and promote collaborative best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience in backend software engineering, with a proven track record of designing and building scalable, distributed, and highly available systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly proficient in backend development. We primarily use Go, Kotlin, Ruby, Python — while prior experience in these specific languages is beneficial, a strong foundation in modern backend engineering and a willingness to learn is what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event streaming platforms like Kafka, Apache Flink, or others for real-time data processing and message queueing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record working with search engines, information retrieval and ranking optimisations technologies (e.g., Vespa, Elasticsearch, OpenSearch) is a high advantage. If not, we expect you to have a strong willingness and motivation to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are enthusiastic about AI technologies, use AI tools daily in your work, and proactively learn and experiment with how to adopt AI to boost engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of continuous integration and deployment pipelines, with experience in tools like Jenkins for automating builds and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and monitoring tools (we use Grafana, Kibana, and others) to keep services healthy and define SLIs/SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and in-memory databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience working with cross-functional peers (Product, Analytics, SRE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mentoring other engineers, providing constructive feedback, and promoting engineering best practices within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Die jährliche Bruttogehaltsspanne für diese Position beträgt:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€87.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€118.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is a Version 1 company and &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://2429507.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2429507/CreateFuture%20Benefits%20(2026)%20(1).pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;CreateFuture are looking for a collaborative and pragmatic Lead Product Manager to join our growing team and help us define and develop an exciting array of products over a variety of industries, technologies and domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Product Managers are responsible for working with senior leadership, our internal design and engineering teams and our clients to help define and implement product strategies that are consistent with our clients’ vision. This can be from early stage research and market analysis through to development, delivery and iteration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As we rapidly scale, we’ve identified an exciting opportunity for a Lead Product Manager to help support our growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This person will be responsible for shaping and leading client engagements. We have a variety of clients across many industries all of whom look to us to provide leadership and guidance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will rapidly gain their trust and guide them toward a valuable customer focused outcome. To do this you’ll use your deep understanding of product management methodologies and a consistent application of good practice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will also be responsible for the wellbeing of a team of product managers. You will help embed good practice and coach your team in client management techniques and the application of product management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Does this sound like you? Do you have experience in developing Product Managers and a passion for the craft of Product Management? Do you have an empathetic leadership style with a focus on coaching each person to help grow their career and skills? If so, we’ve got a great role for you to stretch your wings and see what you’re really capable of.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reporting into the Head of Product Operations and be able to represent the team as we grow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Leading a team of Product Managers and support recruitment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Helping embed and support career progression pathways using our development framework for personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Providing support to the team through mentorship and coaching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Acting as an escalation point for the team, helping to remove internal and external blockers as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Supporting resourcing of Product Managers on projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Identifying training and development needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead clients through their digital transformation journey, ensuring long term lasting relationships are made with key decision-makers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Working with the team to improve, shape and structure the Product Management ways of working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Passionate about Product Management as a discipline and keen to keep up to date on emerging trends, as well as experimenting with new tools and techniques&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recent relevant experience of leading product focused engagements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge and experience of Product Management frameworks and approaches for continuous discovery and delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have experience of product research and collecting evidence to support value propositions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a digital transformation and AI consultancy, delivering technology solutions to enterprise clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience applying AI to products, services or delivery, with a good understanding of how AI can create value for clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring, coaching and developing Product Managers and supporting the growth of product capability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have experience of using data to help drive decisions and steer the direction of the product towards the client’s north star&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of web and mobile technologies and practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience leading or supporting&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;client discovery, workshops and product strategy, translating business needs into digital solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be comfortable with ambiguity and help provide clarity in all situations&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;C09EB214JQN-1787053784.111639-thread-list-Thread_1787056669.790799&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re particularly interested in people who are curious about how AI is changing the craft of Product Management and are actively exploring what that means in practice.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bonus points if you:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience shaping or delivering AI-enabled products, services or propositions, from early discovery through to live products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the opportunities and limitations of LLMs, generative AI and agentic systems, and can translate these into meaningful customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with AI-native product development, using AI to accelerate research, discovery, prototyping, analysis, documentation or decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can identify where AI agents or automation could change a customer journey, business process or product experience, rather than simply adding AI features to an existing product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand some of the new product considerations AI introduces — including evaluation, trust, human oversight, data, governance and responsible AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are proactive about new AI capabilities, tools and ways of working, and enjoy helping others build their confidence and capability too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You don’t need to arrive as an AI expert. If you haven’t yet had much opportunity to put AI into practice, that shouldn’t stop you applying. What matters to us is curiosity, a willingness to experiment and excitement about how AI is changing products and the craft of Product Management. Everyone at CreateFuture undertakes AI-native training, and we’ll support you to build these capabilities and put them into practice.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Manager -&amp;nbsp; Robotic Picking | Outbound | Hybrid Working | Hatfield&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are Ocado Group and we&#39;re bringing world-class automation to online grocery. Our Ocado Smart Platform (OSP) combines cutting-edge robotics, AI and IoT within our advanced CFCs (Customer Fulfilment Centres). We&#39;ve mastered the single pick, transforming online delivery for our global partners. Join us and be part of a team pushing the boundaries of retail technology.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As the Product Manager for Robotic Picking (OGRP), you will own Ocado’s flagship automated picking capability, which has completed over 350 million picks in production to date. Sitting within our Outbound Product Area, you will operate at the intersection of software, robotics and physical operations - optimising performance and profitability where decisions show up in production within days, not quarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Operating as the highest individual contributor level in Product, you will serve as a recognized domain authority for Product Directors and VPs, with the capability and strategic breadth to step into a Director role. Day to day, you will manage the boundary between what the robot can reliably pick, how orders get planned and packed and what the CFC can execute without losing throughput or delivery quality. You will drive cross-area strategy, influence senior engineering counterparts and collaborate with commercial leaders to accelerate feature adoption and scale OGRP across new global sites.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the vision, roadmap and adoption outcomes for Ocado’s on-grid robotic picking (OGRP) capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Manage product range extension, using data on damage rates and pick success to balance range growth against operational risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Design seamless integration between robotic picking, manual stations order packing and downstream CFC workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Lead exception design and site readiness, establishing criteria that allow OGRP to launch reliably across diverse global layouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Drive rigorous experimentation and hypothesis testing, holding cross-functional teams to high standards of evidence and validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;Maintain clear visibility over P&amp;amp;L lines influenced by your domain, making critical Build vs. Buy calls and establishing metrics tied directly to business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary market intelligence resource and go-to domain expert for Product Directors, VPs and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,7,0&quot;&gt;Mobilise and lead through expertise and influence, mentoring surrounding PMs and actively contributing to the broader product leadership group.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;A seasoned Product Leader/Manager with a proven track record of driving impact at scale within complex technical or commercial domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex business environments and influence organizational strategy at the senior leadership and C-suite level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Strong data and commercial fluency, with the ability to manage P&amp;amp;L impacts, build financial rationales and defend prioritization decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;Comfort making high-quality, decisive choices under conditions of ambiguity, high operational stakes and physical constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Exceptional communication skills, with experience presenting complex product strategies to internal leadership and external clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Nice to Haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;Valuable expertise in robotics, automated fulfilment, warehouse operations or complex hardware/software integrations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here’s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more – and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Family-first policies:&lt;/strong&gt; 22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
