&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;5be13d0a36e6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Confidence with the Python programming language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;cc36332b58c5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Previous experience managing a cross-functional software team successfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;🏆 Some of the perks of working with us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;3f93816393a9&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Unparalleled opportunities to learn and accelerated career development.&lt;/li&gt;
