&lt;h1&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Industrial companies hold millions of spare parts, and many more are available from resellers, distributors, and the companies that build production lines. Your mission is to connect these worlds. You will build SPARETECH&#39;s supply network: the partners who sell parts to our customers and the partners who buy parts from them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will define how we work with resellers, distributors, and line builders, win them as partners, and turn these partnerships into new ways for manufacturers to find, buy, and sell the parts that keep their production running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you the opportunity to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a new channel from the ground up:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Shape SPARETECH&#39;s partnership strategy for resellers, distributors, and line builders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win strategic partners:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Lead partner acquisition from first conversation to signed agreement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the deal:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Develop value propositions and commercial models that work for our partners and our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape what we build:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work with Product and Engineering to bring partner offerings into the SPARETECH platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create value in both directions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Help our customers buy the parts they need and sell the parts they no longer use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take real ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work closely with leadership in a role where your strategy and execution are visible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work remote-first:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work from within Germany as part of an international team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a part of the team if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have 6+ years of experience in business development, partnerships, channel management, or key account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Know the industry:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have worked in or with manufacturing, industrial distribution, automation, or OEM after-sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have structured and negotiated commercial partnerships with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think and execute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Can design a partnership approach from scratch and run it hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay persistent:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Enjoy long sales cycles and building trust over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speak fluently:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Are fluent in German and English (C1 or higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-yes company, where you can decide every day whether you work from home, at our Stuttgart or Munich office, or at any&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.designoffices.de/&quot;&gt;Design Office&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A permanent employment contract, 30 days of vacation, and the opportunity to participate in the company&#39;s success through our VSOP program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern hardware and the frame for a height-adjustable desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual training budget of 1000 EURO for your professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Germany: A subsidized&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jobrad.org/&quot;&gt;job bike&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to escape city traffic and a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qualitrain.net/&quot;&gt;Wellpass&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;gym membership to stay active&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/Corporate-identity-templates-2003b5c0fdd84c1d833435833aaea51a?pvs=21&quot;&gt;Corporate Benefits&lt;/a&gt;, including discounts on fashion, travel, and much more from various companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic start-up atmosphere and an international team in which new ideas, creative approaches, and cooperation at eye level are valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SPARETECH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SPARETECH&#39;s vision is to empower the zero-waste industrial sharing economy by enabling maintenance and procurement teams at manufacturing leaders like Bosch, Porsche, and Nestlé to reduce MRO spend and optimize inventory through accurate part information, internal transparency, and market visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, we have built, and continue to build, an AI-powered MRO software that connects all players in the spare parts ecosystem, from manufacturers and suppliers to the people working behind the machines. By facilitating the exchange of data, knowledge, and expertise, we create shared visibility that empowers smarter decisions, reduces waste, and drives seamless collaboration. This connected spare parts intelligence unlocks value that extends far beyond software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.thesaasnews.com/news/sparetech-raises-10-million-in-series-a&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1257119756&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, SPARETECH is accelerating its growth with a strong focus on product innovation and team excellence. We take pride in our inclusive and collaborative culture, as well as our energetic and committed team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT ROCKET LAB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Lab is the end-to-end space company building rockets, spacecraft, and critical subsystems that keep the world connected, protected, expand humanity’s reach to the Moon, Mars, and beyond. We move fast, build real hardware for meaningful missions, and make the impossible routine. Come shape the future with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SPACE SYSTEMS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rocket Lab, we’re not just launching rockets — we&#39;re building the future of space. Our Space Systems team builds everything from complete spacecraft, precision payloads to the components and subsystems that allow them to thrive in space, like solar panels, flight software, star trackers, optical systems, separation systems, radios, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Space Systems team has enabled more than 1,700 missions, ranging from interplanetary exploration, in-space manufacturing to national security and defense initiatives. The team has built spacecraft, payloads, and components for missions to the Moon and Mars, working with partners including NASA, the Space Development Agency, and the U.S. Space Force. Whether it’s a single high-performance spacecraft, constellation, or the vertically integrated components that help them get to space — our world class Space Systems team is empowering some of the boldest and most ambitious space missions.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIRECTOR - BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT, SPACE SYSTEMS&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Based in &lt;strong&gt;Munich, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;, as the &lt;strong&gt;Director - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive Rocket Lab’s growth in the European satellite market, with a primary focus on Germany and strategic opportunities across Europe. You will work with a range of customers, including government, defense, civil space, commercial, and prime contractor organizations, with a particular focus on national security and sovereign European space capabilities. Your role will involve identifying and engaging with potential clients, developing strategic partnerships, and leading efforts to secure contracts that expand our market share in this rapidly growing sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET TO DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead business development initiatives focused on satellite solutions for defense, national security, civil space, and commercial applications across Germany and Europe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Develop and execute capture strategies for securing large defense, civil space, and government contracts, including opportunities with German and European government agencies, defense organizations, space institutions, and prime contractors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Engage with key customer stakeholders, government officials, policymakers, and industry leaders to build and maintain long-term relationships, ensuring Rocket Lab’s solutions align with their evolving mission requirements and strategic priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain relationships across the German and European space and defense ecosystem, including government organizations, prime contractors, industry partners, and relevant European institutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Government Affairs and cross-functional teams to support market expansion, customer engagement, and pursuit of government-funded programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to prepare and deliver compelling proposals that meet customer requirements and win new business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Monitor German and European industry trends, government priorities, procurement initiatives, policy developments, and competitor activities to inform and adapt our business development strategies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Grow existing business opportunities and nurture relationships with existing customers to develop additional business opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Create new business opportunities and relationships by presenting Rocket Lab’s capabilities/experience to provide satellite solutions – including bus offerings and complete satellites to meet mission requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Identify and pursue opportunities associated with European sovereign space and defense capabilities, dual-use technologies, and evolving European procurement priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead and/or participate in proposal activities, including generation of technical, management, cost, schedule, and proposal content for new business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Develop strong relationships across all levels of the business to ensure alignment, efficiency, and collaboration, including coordinating with stakeholders across Business Development, Government Affairs, Engineering, Program Management, and Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Represent Rocket Lab at industry conferences, government forums, industry associations, and customer meetings across Germany and Europe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Build awareness of relevant European government programs and procurement pathways, including opportunities involving ESA, the European Union, EUSPA, the European Defense Agency, DLR, and German defense and space organizations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Support Rocket Lab’s positioning within the evolving European space and defense landscape, including launch sovereignty, European sovereign capability, dual-use technology, and defense modernization priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Develop an understanding of relevant export control and regulatory considerations affecting Rocket Lab’s ability to pursue European opportunities, including ITAR/EAR and applicable German and European requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Travel as needed for business opportunities, customer meetings, industry events, and capture activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Other duties as assigned or required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU’LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in engineering or other technical discipline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;12+ years of experience in business development, program management, or systems engineering within the aerospace, space, defense, or related technology sector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of government acquisition processes, government contracting, and the national security landscape within Germany and/or Europe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of securing large (&amp;gt;$20M) contracts and managing strategic relationships within the aerospace, space, or defense industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience building and managing relationships with senior government officials, defense organizations, policymakers, prime contractors, and other public- and private-sector stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Professional fluency in German and English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of German and European defense priorities, civil space programs, government procurement processes, and the broader European space and defense ecosystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ability to support frequent domestic and international travel (up to 50%) to meet with clients, attend industry events, and support capture efforts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ability to obtain and maintain any required German or European security clearance, if applicable to assigned programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THESE QUALIFICATIONS WOULD BE NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in aerospace engineering or related engineering field; or business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Specialization in German or European government business development, with deep experience selling to German or European national security, defense, civil space, or government customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrable record of success in business development, sales, program management and/or engineering of satellite systems, payloads, or platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Extensive awareness of current and ongoing German and European government national security, defense, civil space, and satellite programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience working with or within organizations such as DLR, Bundeswehr, BAAINBw, German federal government entities, ESA, EUSPA, the European Defense Agency, EU defense bodies, NATO, or other European space and defense institutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience pursuing European government-funded programs and navigating German or EU defense and space procurement pathways&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with European sovereign space and defense initiatives, including the European Defense Fund (EDF), European Defense Industry Program (EDIP), EU Space Program initiatives, and related European defense modernization priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with NATO space and defense structures and European security and resilience priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Understanding of export control regimes and regulatory considerations relevant to European business development, including ITAR/EAR and German/EU requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication and presentation skills in both German and English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience leading, managing, and growing geographically dispersed teams on fast-paced projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proficient in all Microsoft Suite products, including MS Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;General knowledge of industry specific technical requirements and quality requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience using customer relationship management (CRM) software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with proposal development, writing, and best practice capture processes, and ability to independently complete cost and technical proposals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience working with subject matter experts to collect and create compelling proposal content and detailed responses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By applying for the above position, you will confirm that you have reviewed and agreed to our:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://rocketlabcorp.com/assets/Rocket-Lab-Germany-Candidate-Privacy-Policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Data Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to unlock the potential of space to improve life on Earth, but that’s not an easy task. It takes hard work, determination, relentless innovation, teamwork, grit, and an unwavering commitment to achieving what others often deem impossible. Our people out-think, out-work, and out-pace. We pride ourselves on having each other’s backs, checking our egos at the door, and rolling up our sleeves on all tasks big and small. We thrive under pressure, work to tight deadlines, and our focus is always on how we can deliver, rather than dwelling on the challenges that stand in the way.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
